# CMU subject 02's walk read from its ASF skeleton and AMC take (#948),
# cropped to 0.5 to 2.0 s, two events on it, played at 1.5 times its pace.
capture walk tests/fixtures/people/cmu/02_01.amc asf tests/fixtures/people/cmu/02.asf from 0.5 to 2.0 event left 0.8 event right 1.3
state walking walk once rate 1.5
play walking
